  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What these links are, and why netdev would lie",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "\n`rocep1s0f1` (**RoCE rail 1**, via `enp1s0f1np1`, 10.100.184.0/24) and\n`roceP2p1s0f1` (**RoCE rail 2**, via `enP2p1s0f1np1`, 10.100.185.0/24) are the\nConnectX links carrying NCCL tensor-parallel traffic between Spark 1 and\nSpark 2. NCCL runs over **IB verbs** on both rails\n(`NET/IB : Using [0]rocep1s0f1:1/RoCE [1]roceP2p1s0f1:1/RoCE`).\n\nEvery panel here reads the **InfiniBand** counters. RDMA traffic never touches\nthe kernel network stack, so the ordinary netdev byte counters stay flat\nduring a generation \u2014 measured: IB +335 MB and +76 MB, netdev +170 kB and\n**exactly zero** over the same window. A netdev-based panel would show a dead\nfabric on a perfectly healthy one.\n\nThe `...f0` ports are DOWN by design on this hardware and are excluded.\n**Traffic here while a prompt generates is the proof that the model is\ngenuinely distributed.**\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Link state",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "RoCE port state",
      "description": "All four (two rails x two Sparks) should read ACTIVE in dual mode.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "dgx-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "dgx-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "node_infiniband_state_id{device=~\"rocep1s0f1|roceP2p1s0f1\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{node}} {{device}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": null,
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "DOWN"
                },
                "4": {
                  "text": "ACTIVE"
                }
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#F43F5E",
                "value": null
